><details class=\"nav__mobile\"><summary class=\"nav__burger\" aria-label=\"Navigation menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu nav__burger-open\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x nav__burger-close\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg></summary><nav class=\"nav__sheet\" aria-label=\"All pages\"><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Services</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/devsecops\">Secure SDLC<span class=\"nav__sheet-blurb\">The page that explains why one firm does both. Start here.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/cybersecurity\">Cybersecurity</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/software-development\">Software Development</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/application-security\">Application Security</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\">GRC &amp; Compliance</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/custom-software\">Custom Software</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/engagement-models\">Engagement Models</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services\">All <!-- -->services</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Industries</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/financial-services\">Financial Services</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/healthcare\">Healthcare</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/saas\">SaaS &amp; Technology</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/logistics\">Logistics</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/public-sector\">Public Sector</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/retail\">Retail &amp; Payments</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries\">All <!-- -->industries</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Proof</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/sample-report\">Anatomy of a report<span class=\"nav__sheet-blurb\">Walk a real deliverable, redacted. See what actually lands in your inbox.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/case-studies\">Case Studies</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/customers\">Customers</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/certifications\">Certifications</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/trust\">Trust Centre</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Resources</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/resources\">All resources</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/blog\">Insights</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/research\">Research &amp; Labs</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/tools\">Open-source tools</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/methodologies\">Methodologies</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Company</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/about/leadership\">Leadership</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/approach\">The Adversary Loop</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/careers\">Careers</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/newsroom\">Newsroom</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-cta\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--md btn--full\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span></a><a class=\"nav__sheet-hotline\" href=\"tel:+442045259100\">Incident response, 24/7 — <!-- -->+44 20 4525 9100</a></div></nav></details></div></div></header><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" style=\"padding-top:calc(var(--nav-h) + var(--s16))\" aria-labelledby=\"ce-title\"><div class=\"u-container\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">Certifications</p><h1 id=\"ce-title\" style=\"font-size:var(--text-3xl);margin:var(--s3) 0 0;max-width:20ch\">Ours, with certificate numbers</h1><p class=\"ce-lead\">Every mark below carries its issuing body, its stated scope, its certificate number where one is issued, and its expiry date. One standard we do not hold is listed too, with the reason. Our wider posture is on<!-- --> <a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/trust\">the trust centre</a>.</p></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"ce-held\"><div class=\"u-container\"><h2 id=\"ce-held\" style=\"font-size:var(--text-2xl);margin:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:var(--s2)\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Held — <!-- -->6<!-- --> certifications</h2><ul class=\"reveal-group certs\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg cert\"><div class=\"cert__head\"><h3 class=\"cert__label\">ISO/IEC 27001:2022 — Information Security Management</h3><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Both pillars</span></div><dl class=\"cert__fields\"><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Certificate no.</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono cert__value--strong cert__value--absent\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"ce-sr\">Not stated</span></dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Issuer</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono\">UKAS-accredited certification body</dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Scope</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono\">Delivery of cybersecurity and software development services, London and Dhaka.</dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Issued</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono cert__value--strong\">2026-03-14</dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Expires</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono cert__value--strong\">2029-03-13</dd></div></dl></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg cert\"><div class=\"cert__head\"><h3 class=\"cert__label\">ISO 9001:2015 — Quality Management</h3><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Software</span></div><dl class=\"cert__fields\"><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Certificate no.</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono cert__value--strong cert__value--absent\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"ce-sr\">Not stated</span></dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Issuer</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono\">UKAS-accredited certification body</dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Scope</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono\">Software development delivery.</dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Issued</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono cert__value--strong\">2025-09-02</dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Expires</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono cert__value--strong\">2028-09-01</dd></div></dl></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg cert\"><div class=\"cert__head\"><h3 class=\"cert__label\">SOC 2 Type II — Security, Availability, Confidentiality</h3><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Both pillars</span></div><dl class=\"cert__fields\"><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Certificate no.</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono cert__value--strong cert__value--absent\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"ce-sr\">Not stated</span></dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Issuer</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono\">Independent CPA firm</dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Scope</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono\">Envenox engagement platform and evidence workspace. Report available under NDA.</dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Issued</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono cert__value--strong\">2026-06-30</dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Expires</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono cert__value--strong\">2027-06-29</dd></div></dl></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg cert\"><div class=\"cert__head\"><h3 class=\"cert__label\">Cyber Essentials Plus — audited technical controls</h3><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Both pillars</span></div><dl class=\"cert__fields\"><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Certificate no.</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono cert__value--strong cert__value--absent\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"ce-sr\">Not stated</span></dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Issuer</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono\">IASME, on behalf of the NCSC</dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Scope</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono\">Whole organisation.</dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Issued</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono cert__value--strong\">2026-05-20</dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Expires</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono cert__value--strong\">2027-05-19</dd></div></dl></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg cert\"><div class=\"cert__head\"><h3 class=\"cert__label\">CREST member — penetration testing</h3><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Security</span></div><dl class=\"cert__fields\"><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Certificate no.</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono cert__value--strong cert__value--absent\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"ce-sr\">Not stated</span></dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Issuer</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono\">CREST International</dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Scope</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono\">Penetration testing services.</dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Issued</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono cert__value--strong\">2024-11-01</dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Expires</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono cert__value--strong\">2027-10-31</dd></div></dl></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg cert\"><div class=\"cert__head\"><h3 class=\"cert__label\">PCI QSA — qualified assessor company</h3><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Security</span></div><dl class=\"cert__fields\"><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Certificate no.</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono cert__value--strong cert__value--absent\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">—</span><span class=\"ce-sr\">Not stated</span></dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Issuer</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono\">PCI Security Standards Council</dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Scope</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono\">PCI DSS 4.0 assessment and advisory.</dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Issued</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono cert__value--strong\">2026-01-15</dd></div><div class=\"cert__row\"><dt class=\"cert__key u-mono\">Expires</dt><dd class=\"cert__value u-mono cert__value--strong\">2027-01-14</dd></div></dl></div></li></ul><h2 style=\"font-size:var(--text-2xl);margin:var(--s24) 0 0\">Not held</h2><ul class=\"notheld\" aria-label=\"Standards we do not hold\"><li><div class=\"notheld__head\"><h3 class=\"notheld__name u-mono\">ISO/IEC 27701</h3><span class=\"notheld__state u-mono\">Not held</span></div><p class=\"notheld__note\">Privacy controls are operated under the 27001 ISMS. We have not sought separate 27701 certification and will say so rather than implying it.</p></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"ce-creds\"><div class=\"u-container\"><h2 id=\"ce-creds\" style=\"font-size:var(--text-2xl);margin:0\">Individual credentials across the team</h2><ul class=\"creds\" aria-label=\"Team credentials by count\"><li class=\"cred\"><p class=\"cred__count u-tnum\">14</p><p class=\"cred__label\">OSCP</p></li><li class=\"cred\"><p class=\"cred__count u-tnum\">6</p><p class=\"cred__label\">CISSP</p></li><li class=\"cred\"><p class=\"cred__count u-tnum\">4</p><p class=\"cred__label\">CREST CRT</p></li><li class=\"cred\"><p class=\"cred__count u-tnum\">3</p><p class=\"cred__label\">OSWE</p></li><li class=\"cred\"><p class=\"cred__count u-tnum\">5</p><p class=\"cred__label\">AWS Solutions Architect</p></li><li class=\"cred\"><p class=\"cred__count u-tnum\">2</p><p class=\"cred__label\">ISO 27001 Lead Auditor</p></li></ul><p class=\"ce-note\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/about/leadership\">Who holds what</a></p></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"ce-partners\"><div class=\"u-container\"><h2 id=\"ce-partners\" style=\"font-size:var(--text-2xl);margin:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-handshake\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:var(--s2)\"><path d=\"m11 17 2 2a1 1 0 1 0 3-3\"></path><path d=\"m14 14 2.5 2.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3l-3.88-3.88a3 3 0 0 0-4.24 0l-.88.88a1 1 0 1 1-3-3l2.81-2.81a5.79 5.79 0 0 1 7.06-.87l.47.28a2 2 0 0 0 1.42.25L21 4\"></path><path d=\"m21 3 1 11h-2\"></path><path d=\"M3 3 2 14l6.5 6.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3\"></path><path d=\"M3 4h8\"></path></svg>Partners and tiers</h2><ul class=\"reveal-group partners\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad partner\"><p class=\"partner__name\">Amazon Web Services</p><p class=\"partner__tier u-mono\">Advanced Tier Services Partner</p><p class=\"partner__label\">AWS Advanced Tier Services Partner</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad partner\"><p class=\"partner__name\">Microsoft</p><p class=\"partner__tier u-mono\">Solutions Partner — Security</p><p class=\"partner__label\">Microsoft Solutions Partner, Security</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad partner\"><p class=\"partner__name\">Google Cloud</p><p class=\"partner__tier u-mono\">Partner</p><p class=\"partner__label\">Google Cloud Partner</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad partner\"><p class=\"partner__name\">CrowdStrike</p><p class=\"partner__tier u-mono\">Elevate Partner</p><p class=\"partner__label\">CrowdStrike Elevate Partner</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad partner\"><p class=\"partner__name\">Cloudflare</p><p class=\"partner__tier u-mono\">Services Partner</p><p class=\"partner__label\">Cloudflare Services Partner</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad partner\"><p class=\"partner__name\">HashiCorp</p><p class=\"partner__tier u-mono\">Partner</p><p class=\"partner__label\">HashiCorp Partner</p></div></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"ce-cta\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"humans\"><div><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">Get started</p><h2 id=\"ce-cta\" style=\"font-size:var(--text-3xl);margin:var(--s3) 0 0\">Book a 60-minute scoping call</h2><p style=\"color:var(--muted-strong);max-width:52ch;margin-top:var(--s4)\">A technical conversation with the person who would lead the work — not a qualification script, not a discovery deck. You come away with a written scope, the exclusions stated in the body rather than in an appendix, and a day count that we have not padded.</p><div class=\"humans__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span><span class=\"btn__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--lg\" href=\"/trust\"><span>Our own security posture</span><span class=\"btn__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div><p class=\"humans__sla\">A named engineer replies within one business day. Scoping call within three.</p></div><ul class=\"humans__people\" aria-label=\"Who replies to a new enquiry\"><li class=\"human\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder portrait for Claire Benoit\" class=\"avatar-ph\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;font-size:16px;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(153 18% 22%), hsl(153 22% 14%))\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">CB</span></div><div><p class=\"human__name\">Claire Benoit</p><p class=\"human__role\">Practice Director, Governance &amp; Risk</p></div></li><li class=\"human\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder portrait for Marcus Reid\" class=\"avatar-ph\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;font-size:16px;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(319 18% 22%), hsl(319 22% 14%))\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">MR</span></div><div><p class=\"human__name\">Marcus Reid</p><p class=\"human__role\">Head of Engineering</p></div></li><li class=\"human\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder portrait for Amara Nwosu\" class=\"avatar-ph\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;font-size:16px;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(334 18% 22%), hsl(334 22% 14%))\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">AN</span></div><div><p class=\"human__name\">Amara Nwosu</p><p class=\"human__role\">Chief Operating Officer</p></div></li></ul></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"foot theme-dark transition-theme grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"foot__top\"><div class=\"foot__brand\"><a class=\"foot__wordmark\" href=\"/\">Envenox</a><p class=\"foot__positioning\">Envenox is a software development firm. We ship production systems — custom software, web applications, ERP and the platforms underneath them — and we keep an offensive security practice on staff that attacks what we build before anyone else gets the chance.</p><a class=\"foot__hotline\" href=\"tel:+442045259100\" data-ir-hotline=\"footer\"><span class=\"foot__hotline-row\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg><span class=\"u-eyebrow\">Incident response — 24/7</span></span><span class=\"foot__hotline-number\">+44 20 4525 9100</span><span class=\"foot__hotline-note\">Answered by a responder, 24/7. Median pickup under 4 minutes.</span></a></div><nav class=\"foot__cols\" aria-label=\"Footer\"><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Cybersecurity</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/application-security\">Application Security</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/cloud-security\">Cloud Security</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/red-teaming\">Red Teaming</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/incident-response\">Incident Response</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\">GRC &amp; Compliance</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/vciso\">vCISO</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Software Development</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/custom-software\">Custom Software</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/web-application-development\">Web Applications</a></li><li><a cl